{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "6f4b9a52-1c3e-4d7a-9b2f-0a7c5e8d1f21",
    "name": "OficioYa Service - Solicitudes",
    "description": "Coleccion para probar los endpoints del servicio de solicitudes de OficioYa.\n\n## Preparacion\n1. Importar esta coleccion y el environment `OficioYa Local`.\n2. Levantar el servicio en `http://localhost:8081` con el perfil `dev`.\n3. Poner en la variable `userId` el UUID del usuario que quieres simular.\n\n## Importante\nEl servicio **no exige autenticacion**. El usuario se envia en el header `X-User-Id`.\n\n- Para aceptar o rechazar, `userId` debe coincidir con el `workerId` de la solicitud.\n- Para resolver un conflicto, `userId` debe coincidir con el `contractorId`.\n- Si no se envia el header, la API responde 400.\n\n## Nota\nEl login sigue disponible en `/api/v1/auth/login`, pero es opcional y no se usa en esta coleccion.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Solicitudes",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Listar mis solicitudes",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (Array.isArray(data) && data.length > 0) {",
                  "  pm.environment.set('requestId', data[0].id);",
                  "  console.log('requestId guardado: ' + data[0].id);",
                  "} else {",
                  "  console.log('No hay solicitudes para este usuario');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-User-Id",
                "value": "{{userId}}",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/requests",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "requests"
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Aceptar solicitud (TRABAJADOR)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Respuesta controlada (200, 400, 404 o 409)', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect([200, 400, 404, 409]).to.include(pm.response.code);",
                  "});",
                  "console.log(pm.response.text());"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-User-Id",
                "value": "{{userId}}",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/requests/{{requestId}}/accept",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "requests",
                "{{requestId}}",
                "accept"
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Rechazar solicitud (TRABAJADOR)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Respuesta controlada (200, 400, 404 o 409)', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect([200, 400, 404, 409]).to.include(pm.response.code);",
                  "});",
                  "console.log(pm.response.text());"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-User-Id",
                "value": "{{userId}}",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/requests/{{requestId}}/reject",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "requests",
                "{{requestId}}",
                "reject"
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Resolver conflicto (CONTRATANTE)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
